  {
    "description": "Find open appointment times for 1 to 3 services done back-to-back by one staff member. serviceIds: service ids from list_services are preferred; an exact service name (or alias) also works. staffId is a staff id from list_staff or 'any'; their exact name also works. Give date (YYYY-MM-DD, the date in the tenant's timezone; get_current_tenant_time gives today's date) or window {from,to} in the same format; with neither it finds the first available day. With date, optional startTime (HH:MM) checks that exact time: slots start there if it is open, else the next open times. Optional partOfDay (morning, afternoon, evening) and limit (max 5). Offer at most 3 slots using their spoken text. blockedUntil is when that staff member is free again (end plus clean-up time). With no slots, say reasonIfNone truthfully and offer nextOpenDate. Re-check if more than 2 minutes pass before booking.",
    "name": "scheduling_check_availability",
    "parameters": {
